A Sofa Box card is built from Raspberry Pi OS and other free software (Chromium, mpv, FFmpeg, Luanti and
more), each under its own licence. Every part on a card, with its licence and source, is listed in
deploy/sofa-box/home/credits.json and shown on the box under Settings -> This box -> About -> Credits
and licences. Games whose data is not free software are never on a card; a box installs them only when
its owner asks.

